msgid "故障观测与保留责任"
msgstr "Fault observation and retained responsibility"

msgid ""
"Core 的 `nx_fault_observe(domain, reason, file, line)` 是一个可覆盖的有限 "
"观测入口。弱默认实现没有状态、分配、队列、OS 锁或副作用；没有隐含事件 对象、registry、worker 或实例 "
"RAM。四个标量参数避免将临时事件结构作为 借用对象传给产品。产品若需要记录，必须提供一个强实现和自身的静态存储。"
msgstr ""
"Core's `nx_fault_observe(domain, reason, file, line)` is an overridable, "
"bounded observation entry. The weak default implementation has no state, "
"allocation, queue, OS lock or side effect; it introduces no implicit event "
"object, registry, worker or instance RAM. Four scalar parameters avoid "
"lending a temporary event structure to the product. Products that need "
"recording must supply a strong implementation and their own static storage."

msgid "终止调用路径"
msgstr "Terminal call paths"

msgid ""
"维护的 FreeRTOS 默认 assert/stack-overflow hook 在 park 前调用观测入口。 stack hook "
"不解引用可能损坏的 task/name。返回的 observer 不会允许损坏 的内核继续执行，也不会释放 request、栈、TCB、IRQ 或 "
"DMA 借用。"
msgstr ""
"The maintained FreeRTOS default assert/stack-overflow hooks call the "
"observation entry before parking. The stack hook does not dereference "
"potentially corrupted task/name pointers. A returning observer does not "
"allow a corrupted kernel to continue or release request, stack, TCB, IRQ or "
"DMA borrows."

msgid ""
"FreeRTOS terminal path 用只读 Arch leaf 读取当前 masks。已有 PRIMASK、 "
"FAULTMASK，或者等于/强于 kernel ceiling 的 BASEPRI 保持不变；其他情况 使用实际 port 的禁用操作。这样不会被 "
"Mainline port 的直接 BASEPRI store 减弱已有 mask。Baseline/POSIX 编译仍遵循各自 port，不声称主机有"
" MCU IRQ。 这是单核终止合同；observer 必须保持进入时的 masks。"
msgstr ""
"The FreeRTOS terminal path reads current masks through a read-only Arch "
"leaf. Existing PRIMASK, FAULTMASK, or BASEPRI equal to or stronger than the "
"kernel ceiling remains unchanged; otherwise it uses the actual port's "
"disable operation. This prevents a Mainline port's direct BASEPRI store from"
" weakening an existing mask. Baseline/POSIX builds still follow their own "
"ports and do not claim MCU IRQs on the host. This is a single-core terminal "
"contract; the observer must preserve incoming masks."

msgid ""
"`nx_freertos_assert_failed` 和 stack hook 本身仍允许强覆盖。直接覆盖它们 会替换默认观测，因此产品须显式保留 "
"`nx_fault_observe` 调用，并保证 non-returning。公共声明保持 C11/C++ ABI；返回到损坏的 "
"`configASSERT` 调用者 不属于允许行为。"
msgstr ""
"`nx_freertos_assert_failed` and the stack hook can still be strongly "
"overridden. Overriding them replaces default observation, so the product "
"must explicitly retain the `nx_fault_observe` call and guarantee non-"
"returning behavior. Public declarations retain the C11/C++ ABI; returning to"
" a corrupted `configASSERT` caller is outside the permitted behavior."

msgid ""
"ThreadX 在中央 adapter fail-stop 和 M4 外部 timer setup 失败处，先观测，再 调用产品 fail-stop "
"port。产品 port 返回时 adapter 继续保留并 park；不会 假装 kernel startup、任务 borrow 或 clock "
"effects 已撤销。其支持范围仍以 ThreadX 文档与实际 target 为准，不继承所有 FreeRTOS CPU 组合。"
msgstr ""
"ThreadX observes a central adapter fail-stop or M4 external timer setup "
"failure before invoking the product fail-stop port. If that port returns, "
"the adapter retains responsibility and parks; it does not pretend that "
"kernel startup, task borrows or clock effects have been undone. Support "
"remains defined by the ThreadX document and actual targets and does not "
"inherit every FreeRTOS CPU combination."

msgid "产品合同与限制"
msgstr "Product contract and limits"

msgid ""
"observer 在原来的 task、ISR 或已屏蔽中断上下文运行，权限和上下文不会被 规范化。它必须有界、无分配，不获取 OS 锁、不进入 "
"provider、不改变 accepted request、不释放 retained storage，也不能假定 kernel、clock、 "
"stack、transport 或 peripheral 仍工作。文件名仅为静态源码 literal 或 "
"NULL；不能解引用未知动态内存。损坏栈的观测是 best effort。"
msgstr ""
"The observer runs in the original task, ISR or interrupt-masked context; "
"privilege and context are not normalized. It must be bounded and allocation-"
"free, acquire no OS locks, enter no provider, alter no accepted request, "
"release no retained storage, and assume neither kernel, clock, stack, "
"transport nor peripheral still works. The filename is only a static source "
"literal or NULL; unknown dynamic memory must not be dereferenced. "
"Observation on a corrupted stack is best effort."

msgid ""
"kernel ceiling 不是所有中断的全局静止证明，也不撤销 NMI、DMA 或外围电气 效果。该 API 不实现安全输出、复位、Flash "
"持久化、loan 回收或安全认证。 产品可实现另行审查的 non-returning recovery；责任仍由外部工程承担。"
msgstr ""
"The kernel ceiling does not prove global quiescence of all interrupts and "
"does not revoke NMI, DMA or external electrical effects. This API implements"
" no safe output, reset, Flash persistence, loan reclamation or safety "
"certification. A product may implement separately reviewed non-returning "
"recovery; responsibility remains in the external project."

msgid ""
"`nexus-examples/apps/uart_owner_runtime/fault_policy.*` 演示一个 caller-owned "
"首故障记录和明确的产品 output port。先 release 发布诊断，再调用 port； "
"嵌套/重复报告不能重复输出动作或替换首个故障。未提供或失败的 port 保持 未验证，不 cleanup/reset/reclaim。示例默认不选择任何"
" GPIO 或假定板级安全 电平。成功的软件 callback 也不证明实际电气安全，仍需产品/Board/HIL 验收。"
msgstr ""
"`nexus-examples/apps/uart_owner_runtime/fault_policy.*` demonstrates a "
"caller-owned first-fault record and an explicit product output port. It "
"release-publishes diagnostics before calling the port; nested or repeated "
"reports cannot repeat output actions or replace the first fault. A missing "
"or failed port remains unverified, with no cleanup/reset/reclaim. The "
"example selects no GPIO or assumed board-safe level by default. A successful"
" software callback does not prove electrical safety; product/Board/HIL "
"acceptance remains required."

msgid ""
"Google death contracts 验证默认 hook 的观测→mask→park 顺序、坏 task/name 不解引用、返回 "
"observer 保留 loan，以及强/等/弱 BASEPRI、PRIMASK 和 FAULTMASK。它们使用真实默认生产 hook 和明确的 "
"port/Arch leaf 模型； 实际故障后的可记录性、物理安全输出及最坏时间没有实板资格。"
msgstr ""
"Google death contracts verify the default hook's observation→mask→park "
"order, no dereference of bad task/name, loan retention when an observer "
"returns, and strong/equal/weak BASEPRI, PRIMASK and FAULTMASK. They use the "
"actual default production hooks and explicit port/Arch leaf models; "
"recordability after real faults, physical safe outputs and worst-case time "
"have no board qualification."
